{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "By 6:00 p.m.", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses vs. Regular Future Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the Future Perfect tense to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> tense, the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">will be working</span> at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The person will start work at some point in the future and be working at 4 p.m. It is not clear when the person will stop working. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of the Future Continuous is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + <span class=\"italic\">be</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Next year I<span class=\"strong\">'ll be planning</span> my wedding!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span>, you can sometimes think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You can call me at work at 8 a.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived</span> at the office by 8.  <br/>The train will leave the station at 9 a.m. You will arrive at the station at 9:15 a.m. When you arrive, the train <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of the Future Perfect tense is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will </span>+ <span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I hope that in 10 years, I<span class=\"strong\">'ll have started</span> my own company and I<span class=\"strong\">'ll have become</span> rich.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "* You often use the preposition <span class=\"italic\">by</span> with the Future Perfect to indicate the end of a particular time period.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">By</span> that time newspapers will have disappeared.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for a comparison of the other tenses used to talk about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talk about things that are not decided; <br/>make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future; <br/>make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'll</span> probably <span class=\\\"strong\\\">be</span> married with kids within the next 10 years. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">am going to propose</span> to her in the spring.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'm buying</span> a ring next week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When you talk about schedules\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you know what time this place <span class=\\\"strong\\\">closes</span>?<br/>It <span class=\\\"strong\\\">closes</span> at 1 a.m.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I hope that in 10 years, I'll have started my own company and I'll have become rich.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A lot will change in the next ten years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Well, first I am going to make a lot of money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Next month she'll be moving in with me. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I am going to propose to her in the spring. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm buying a ring next week. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The trees will have disappeared too. The whole planet will have transformed into something unrecognizable to us now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "In the next 10 years scientists will have made teleportation possible.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I hope that in 10 years, I'll have started my own company and I'll have become rich.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll probably be married with kids within the next 10 years. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": 