05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: Hey Pete. Wow, you're reading a newspaper. You are a real Luddite.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, I just got it for free. Anyway, they won't be printing them in the near future.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: I think you should keep it and put it in a time capsule to be opened in 2100. By that time newspapers will have disappeared.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The trees will have disappeared, too. The whole planet will have transformed into something unrecognizable to us now.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: In the next 10 years scientists will have made teleportation possible.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope in that 10 years, I'll have started my own company and I'll have become rich.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: I'll probably be married with kids within the next 10 years.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: Next year I'll be planning my wedding!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You are joking!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: No, dude. I am serious. Mary and I have talked. Next month she'll be moving in with me. I am going to propose to her in the spring. I'm buying a ring next week.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That blows me away. I had no idea.", "time": "30000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: What's your ten year plan?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: My plan? Well, first I am going to make a lot of money. Then I hope to meet a sensitive and caring soul who I can be with for eternity. But I'm not banking on it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: Do you imagine yourself living in Boston in ten years?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm open to whichever way the wind blows me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: That's cool. As long as you are content. A lot will change in the next ten years.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hope so. Hey, do you know what time this place closes?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: It closes at 1 a.m.", "time": "57000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}